WEBVTT

00:15:27.470 --> 00:15:31.039
Ona odlazi na Skype i rjesava stvar.

00:15:31.039 --> 00:15:34.658
Vidimo sam kako se to radi u selu zvanom Digles

00:15:34.658 --> 00:15:36.703
u sjeverozapadnoj Engleskoj

00:15:36.703 --> 00:15:40.007
i duboko u selima Tamil Nadua, Indija,

00:15:40.007 --> 00:15:42.247
udaljenim 3,ooo km.

00:15:42.247 --> 00:15:45.823
Ona to cini jednim obicnim gestom:

00:15:45.823 --> 00:15:47.538
"Ššššš."

00:15:47.538 --> 00:15:50.263
OK?

00:15:50.263 --> 00:15:51.799
Gledajte ovo.

00:15:51.799 --> 00:15:56.055
Baka: Ne mozes me uhvatiti. Ponovite.

00:15:56.055 --> 00:15:59.823
Ne mozes me uhvatiti.

00:15:59.823 --> 00:16:02.791
Djeca: Ne mozes me uhvatiti.